{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2021-03-19 08:00:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIRLINES ADDS NEW NONSTOP FROM ANCHORAGE TO MINNEAPOLIS-ST. PAUL', 'text': "SEATTLE, MARCH 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALASKA AIRLINES ANNOUNCES TODAY NEW SEASONAL SERVICE AT ONE OF THE AIRLINE'S KEY HUBS IN ALASKA WITH NEW NONSTOP SERVICE BETWEEN ANCHORAGE AND MINNEAPOLIS-ST. PAUL. THIS ADDITIONAL NONSTOP FLIGHT MEANS ALASKA AIRLINES WILL PROVIDE THE MOST NONSTOPS FROM THE STATE OF ALASKA THAN ANY OTHER CARRIER."}